# Pairs with TypeOK: a system-origin write ignores the model's rule bound.

MODULE: SystemUpsertUnbounded
TARGET: TypeOK
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a system-origin write ignores the model's rule bound
PERTURBS: SystemUpsert

--- FIND
    /\ Cardinality(rules) < MaxRules
    /\ rules' = rules \cup {r}
    /\ last' = [Blank EXCEPT !.kind = "write", !.actor = "system", !.rule = r]
--- REPLACE
    /\ rules' = rules \cup {r}
    /\ last' = [Blank EXCEPT !.kind = "write", !.actor = "system", !.rule = r]
--- END
